WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.623
One important preprocessing idea is data leakage If
we fit a

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:11.242
scaler or learned encoder using the entire dataset
before evaluation information from validation

00:00:11.268 --> 00:00:16.991
or test data can influence the transformation A
safer workflow fits learned

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:22.228
preprocessing on the training data and applies the
fitted transformation to validation or test data

00:00:23.971 --> 00:00:28.813
Module 1 is not a machine-learning module but this
habit is worth establishing now because

00:00:28.826 --> 00:00:32.023
preprocessing can affect the honesty of later
evaluation
